  "url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/product/melting-graffiti/",
  "description": "Bring urban energy and street-inspired style to your designs with Melting Graffiti, a vibrant layered drip graffiti font that truly captures the essence of city art culture. With bold, edgy letters, the font showcases sharp angular forms, thick strokes, and uniquely eye-catching melting drips that make every character appear as if fresh paint is dripping right off the surface. This font brilliantly combines a dynamic graffiti look with a visually compelling melting effect, making it perfect for projects that need an urban, artistic, and youthful vibe.\nMelting Graffiti is particularly effective for impactful designs such as streetwear branding, skateboards, posters, event flyers, stickers, logos, and album covers. Its layered capabilities allow for creative versatility, enabling users to mix and match vibrant colors for standout results. Whether used digitally or in print, this distinctive drip style ensures that your design commands attention. Ideal for street-inspired art, fashion statements, or bold branding initiatives, Melting Graffiti is the ultimate font choice for creatives looking to inject powerful, urban personality into their visual projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring urban energy and street-inspired style to your designs with Melting Graffiti, a vibrant layered drip graffiti font that truly captures the essence of city art culture. With bold, edgy letters, the font showcases sharp angular forms, thick strokes, and uniquely eye-catching melting drips that make every character appear as if fresh paint is dripping right off the surface. This font brilliantly combines a dynamic graffiti look with a visually compelling melting effect, making it perfect for projects that need an urban, artistic, and youthful vibe.</p>\n<p>Melting Graffiti is particularly effective for impactful designs such as streetwear branding, skateboards, posters, event flyers, stickers, logos, and album covers. Its layered capabilities allow for creative versatility, enabling users to mix and match vibrant colors for standout results. Whether used digitally or in print, this distinctive drip style ensures that your design commands attention. Ideal for street-inspired art, fashion statements, or bold branding initiatives, Melting Graffiti is the ultimate font choice for creatives looking to inject powerful, urban personality into their visual projects.</p>",
